                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1]Experienced on the Meta Quest 3[/h1]\n\nYou can view my VR mod gameplay here: https://youtu.be/3fx3zqV6JgY\n\nThe absolute best way to experience Quake is through the Quake VR: UNLEASHED mod. It totally changes the game. This isn't your grandpa's Quake anymore. This Quake is a physics based VR mod with VR interactions for Melee, Swimming, Throwing, Climbing, Dual-Wielding, and FIRE! Lots and lots of fire. You can burn the whole thing down in VR.\n\nThis VR mod makes the game feel like it was made from the ground up for VR. The VR mod is completely FREE, it's an easy install, and even has a VR tutorial. It is the future of VR. Every game will have a VR mod. This is just the start.\n\nThe question is: are you going to be a part of this revolution?\n\n[quote]I bought this game! If you enjoyed my review, please consider joining my Steam Curator group [url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/CIVRI]Can I VR It?[/url][/quote]",
